                                "sense_id": "d4b1a30a-bd83-3851-8002-2f8cf3a5aea6",
                                "text": "I too am a narco. Have been for about 10 years."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39024290-369c-48d6-a470-c77195c8c397",
                                "sense_id": "d4b1a30a-bd83-3851-8002-2f8cf3a5aea6",
                                "text": "Besides, staying awake on your first day at a new job is definitely NOT a problem (unless you're a narco or something...)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9527f8c0-7d22-49a6-8ae7-0b8626782c32",
                                "sense_id": "d4b1a30a-bd83-3851-8002-2f8cf3a5aea6",
                                "text": "Apneics, Others, and Narcos all gossip merrily on the walk back to our cabins."
